# The site's canonical absolute origin — an OVERRIDE, not a requirement.
#
# lib/siteUrl.ts already knows the production domain, so a normal Vercel
# deploy needs nothing here. Set this only when you want a different origin:
# a fork, a staging host, or a new domain you haven't moved into the code yet.
#
# Whatever this names is what metadataBase, the canonical link, robots.txt and
# sitemap.xml resolve against — and what WhatsApp, LinkedIn and Slack fetch
# og:image from. Point it at the wrong host and previews break quietly.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://pradipta-jana.vercel.app
